# Nested git worktrees (subagent checkouts). They are hidden from `git status`
# by .git/info/exclude, but Prettier does not read that file — so
# `script/format.ts` (`prettier --write .`, which script/generate.ts runs at the
# end) reformats every file inside them. That rewrite lands in the OTHER
# worktree, so the main tree still looks clean while SDK generation appears to
# have reformatted the whole repo.
